  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="A guarded update (id + status=new + submission + updated_at) matched zero rows. Never treated as success by itself: re-read the row and classify.&#xA;- already_persisted: same submission, row already has the intended status (an earlier attempt wrote it).&#xA;- superseded: the row has a newer submission; the newer request will be processed instead.&#xA;- otherwise BusinessRuleException: the row was edited, deleted or changed by someone else; nothing was overwritten." DisplayName="Classify Guard Miss" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
